// ============================================================
// NICK SESSION BOX v10 - VWAP ONLY + SL/RR SCANNER
// Belgium time. 5min chart.
// Asia 03:00-09:00 | London 09:30-15:00 | America 15:30-00:00
//
// SETUPS: 1 BO Long | 2 REV Short | 3 BO Short | 4 REV Long
// NO REGIME. Only VWAP side: with / agst (against) / all
//   with = long above VWAP or short below VWAP
//   agst = long below VWAP or short above VWAP
//
// SCANNER (toggle in settings, group "Scanner"):
//   Every signal of every setup is tracked with a whole grid of
//   SL multipliers x RR values (virtual trades, no extra orders).
//   For each setup x VWAP side the table shows the BEST SL x / RR.
//
// MODE "Auto best (positive only)":
//   a signal is taken only if the best SL/RR combo of its setup + VWAP side
//   has Tot R above your minimum and enough resolved trades. The trade
//   then uses that best SL multiplier and RR.
// MODE "Manual SL/RR": fixed multipliers from the inputs, all 4 setups.
//
// SL: base distance x multiplier. No time exit. SL and TP in one candle = loss.
//   breakout base  = entry -> opposite box side
//   reversal base  = signal candle range/body (multiplier never below 2)
// ============================================================
indicator("NICK Session Box v11 - CHANGES OVERTIME", overlay = true, max_boxes_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500, max_lines_count = 500)

